    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, absolutely. And so I've been saying for 10 months, as we've seen this in our investigations and are looking and reading the documents, that this is the worst scandal of my lifetime and perhaps in the history of the country. And you're exactly right, Chris. And you touched on the one thing that I was my number two, and I only gave you number one, but number two is that everyone needs to know is in the documents that are being dribbled out to Congress, One of them indicates very clearly that the Department of Justice was told to keep the potus, which is the acronym for the President of the United States, informed of everything. Keep them informed of everything they're doing. And that was with regard to infiltrating the Trump campaign it looks like. It looks like infiltrating the Trump campaign as well as everything from the FISA abuse and the attempt to prevent Donald Trump from getting elected. That was apparently going to the president, former president of the United States. That's huge. That is huge.",
