    "turn_text": "andy we get uh... first of all thank you for doing this and thank you for spending some time with us talking about it but you know we get calls i know your office does i know you get asked about this a lot with calls from our listeners all the time often most often uh... on this this very point about the d o j under under the president obama's administration uh... putting you know uh... spies use we use whatever whatever euphemism you want but they're basically putting spies in the campaign, the political campaign, the presidential campaign of the opposite party, informants by whatever you want to call it. The evidence is certainly a preponderance at this point, and it looks very much like it happened. Um, the listeners we, the callers we get are saying, how is, how is just this not top of the news on every network on every station, every day? Um, if this were 1973 or 1974, um, you know, it would be more than Woodward and Bernstein all alone at the Washington Post. It would be, you know, a thousand flowers of Woodward and Bernstein.",
