  {
    "episode_id": 87320,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/7/87320.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. That is one of the frustrations that I have is that Two-fold. Number one, you've got the attorney general that's basically aloof from this, which is also mind-blowing. But then the second thing is, I was talking to someone, one of my colleagues today, and we were discussing this very issue. If this shoe was on the other foot, and Donald Trump had instructed his people to keep him posted and the line uh... in the case that that may have happened here but but doj an fd i were infiltrating a democratic uh... candidate for president i can tell you that there would be already action uh... just unbelievable action of criminal prosecutions uh... media coverage like you know twenty four seven about this and we don't even see it very very much you know i mean we we talk about it And Americans get scandal fatigue. That's by the way, that's a phrase appropriately coined by Bill Clinton. But the reality is we have got to continue, regardless of the fact that the media, many media outlets are ignoring this or actually trying to throw dirt on the story.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_03",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
